PROVENANCE
----------

src/dsp/BossEmu.{h,cpp}
    Copyright (C) 2013, 2014 Sergey V. Mikayev
    LGPL-2.1-or-later, from the MUNT project.

    Cycle-accurate emulation of the BOSS HG61H20R36F reverb gate array.
    Carried essentially verbatim; the only change is `delete ram` corrected to
    `delete[] ram` in the destructor (the buffer is `new short[RAM_SIZE]`).
    The licence header inside those files is authoritative for them.

src/dsp/rrverb10.cpp
src/dsp/resampler_poly.h
src/canvas.config.js
    Written for this module. LGPL-2.1-or-later, to match the above.

    Note that the reference JUCE plugin this port drew on (giulioz/smol-rack)
    is GPL-3.0, but that covers its JUCE wrapper, none of which is used here.
    BossEmu carries its own LGPL notice independent of that repository, and
    only BossEmu was taken.

src/canvas.js
    Generated from src/canvas.config.js by schwung-canvaskit. Committed so the
    repository is self-contained.


PROGRAM ROM
-----------

The unit's 16 KB program ROM is NOT part of this repository and is NOT
distributed with the module. It remains the property of its rights holder.
Users supply their own dump. See README.md.
